# Every change needs review from the repository owner before it can be merged to main.
# (GitHub enforces this through the branch-protection rule "Require review from Code Owners".)
# Later lines win, so the sensitive areas below are listed explicitly even though * already covers them:
# they are the places where a quiet change could cost money, expose logins, or change what runs in production.

